&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Investor Relations Lead in developing and implementing investor relations processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the monthly investor reporting process, ensuring accuracy, alignment, and timely delivery through cross-functional coordination&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare shareholder materials and communications, ensuring consistent, accurate, and compelling messaging (e.g., MD&amp;amp;A, quarterly updates, shareholder webinar, ESG reporting)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage shareholder interaction in a Customer Relationship Management (CRM)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support ad hoc IR requests and day-to-day administrative tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
