&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently enrolled in a relevant bachelor’s or master’s degree (e.g. Finance, Business Administration, Economics)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in Finance, Strategy Consulting, or Investor Relations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication, coordination, and analytical skills with attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency in PowerPoint and Excel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using CRM systems is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive, resourceful, and comfortable navigating ambiguity in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in Aerospace or Deep Tech is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in both English and German, with strong written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subsidised lunch:&lt;/strong&gt; Stay energised with delicious, subsidised lunches every day&lt;/li&gt;
