&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3727 - Manager, BI &amp;amp; Data Management, Global Client Solutions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role forms part of a globally-distributed business intelligence team, whose objective is to ensure that one of our most important global accounts have access to the right data and insights to inform their marketing decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The team’s primary responsibility is to build and maintain, bespoke and xLOB global reporting solutions. Automating the collection and transformation of disparate marketing data into a single source of truth for use by both the agency and the brand. Not only does that mean running and maintaining the solution that already exists, but also continually improving it to incorporate new features, add new data sources, and to aid in deriving new insights in support of ever-evolving business demands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a BI Manager your primary responsibility will be partnering with the planning and measurement teams to craft technical solutions that deliver complete and insightful reporting data. You will help translate requirements into practical BI and data provisioning solutions, working across tools such as Power BI, Tableau, Looker, Looker Studio, cloud data infrastructure, data preparation and ETL processes, and digital marketing data sources.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will interface with client and agency users across 29 markets, gathering their evolving needs, vetting requirements for feasibility and supporting them in the use of the reporting solution. The team also enlists engineers, project and scrum managers, and business analysts who will aid in the build and support of this reporting solution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The data processes you will manage will support 2 global client-side ROI models and a suite of media and operational dashboards and reports in support of agency stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with advertising performance data and measurement, including the role of ad servers, digital marketing platforms and third-party technology vendors such as Google Marketing Platform, Facebook, X/Twitter and DoubleVerify&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding of how media performance should be measured, and experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;using different methods to visualize performance and to tell stories with data&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building of dashboards, reports, repositories, or other demonstrations of your ability to organize, visualize and communicate data using business intelligence tools such as Power BI or Tableau.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytically minded, enabling you to understand and overcome technical and procedural challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills and attention to detail, allowing you to bring structure to an otherwise unstructured situation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong spoken and written communication skills, ensuring your thoughts and needs are heard and understood by a diverse, global audience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can-do attitude, with an ability to multi-task and remain calm and composed under pressure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exude positivity and energy, and you can thrive in a fast-paced and dynamic working environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work best in team environments, and you are a beacon of collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience project managing the delivery of technical solutions, including exposure to agile product development methodologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or supporting underlying data pipelines and ETL, particularly useful if done using Amazon Web Services, including S3 and Redshift, alongside tools such as Adverity and dbt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with WPP Media data and campaign operations tools and processes, including DPAM, OMS, Campaign Management and Campaign Governance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge and experience using other programming and/or statistical languages (e.g. Python, R, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
