kills #differentmakesusbetter&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Ability to leverage internal resources and work as a team #bestteamwins&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Zurich area location preferred&lt;/strong&gt;; candidates based elsewhere in Switzerland must be available for &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;97&quot;&gt;weekly in-person presence&lt;/strong&gt; and customer visits (primarily in &lt;strong&gt;German-speaking Switzerland&lt;/strong&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(236, 240, 241);&quot;&gt;#LI-SS6&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
